      "content": "advice and talking doesn't really change the fact that at the end of the day, people are still dying and suffering. it's not even about me being \"stressed\" anymore. it feels like the whole cycle is just... broken. like, what's the actual point of trying to fix everything when everything is just fundamentally broken? it's exhausting to keep pretending that it matters.",
